  "summary": "I’m a product-focused software engineer passionate about building fast, reliable, and intuitive web applications — especially in the e-commerce space. I thrive at the intersection of clean architecture, real-time interactivity (Livewire/Alpine.js), and scalable backend services (Laravel, PHP, SQL Server).\n\nI enjoy turning business logic into robust code, finding the simplest solution to complex problems, and sweating the small stuff — like ensuring the right tax rate gets applied at checkout or a button stays disabled until it really should be pressed.\n\nIf you need someone who can own both the product and the stack, and who genuinely cares about shipping things that work and scale, let’s connect.",
